        <p>130 LD-ST R, E T WESLEYAN CHURCH WARRINGTON. TO-MORROW (SUNDAY) JUNE lax. SUNDAY SCHOOL ANNIvRRSARY At 10.30 and 6.30 Rev. ROBERT CULLEY. All weleorne. Hymn books provided.</p>
